@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-09 - Guest Checkout

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Checkout / Payment UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail, coupons" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-09
FE -> API: POST /payments or POST /payments/stripe/create-intent
API -> Service: Execute Guest Checkout
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail, coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Redirect đến trang thanh toán

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Stock batch fail -> hiển thị sản phẩm hết hàng
  note over FE,Service: Coupon đã hết lượt dùng -> thông báo lỗi
  note over FE,Service: API lỗi -> thông báo lỗi server
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Cart có ít nhất 1 item
Post: Redirect đến trang thanh toán
Main flow:
1. User bấm Checkout từ cart
2. System chuyển đến trang /checkout
3. User nhập: firstName, lastName, email, phone, address
4. System validate form
5. User chọn payment method: PayOS hoặc Stripe
6. User bấm Place Order
7. System gọi API POST /payments or POST /payments/stripe/create-intent
8. System kiểm tra stock batch, tạo bill, tạo payment liên kết
9. System redirect đến payment URL (PayOS) hoặc hiển thị Stripe form
end note
@enduml
